### 3.1 Get all persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### 3.2 Get info
GET http://localhost:3001/info

### 3.3 Get single person (valid ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/1

### 3.3 Get single person (non-existing ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/999

### 3.4 Delete a person
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/2

### 3.5 Create a new person
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace Hopper",
  "number": "123-456789"
}

### 3.6 Create person error (missing name)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "123-456789"
}

### 3.6 Create person error (missing number)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace Hopper"
}

### 3.6 Create person error (name must be unique)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arto Hellas",
  "number": "040-999999"
}
